+=== ext:zifencei[] Extension for Instruction-Fetch Fence
+This chapter defines the ext:zifencei[] extension, which includes the
+insn:fence.i[] instruction that provides explicit synchronization between writes
+to instruction memory and instruction fetches on the same hart. Currently, this
+instruction is the only standard mechanism to ensure that stores visible to a
+hart will also be visible to its instruction fetches.
 (((store instruction word, not included)))
 
