+We considered but did not include a _store instruction word_ instruction as in
+cite:[majc]. JIT compilers may generate a large trace of instructions before a
+single insn:fence.i[], and amortize any instruction cache snooping or
+invalidation overhead by writing translated instructions to memory regions that
+are known not to reside in the instruction cache.
