+made visible to instruction fetches on a RISC-V hart until that hart executes a
+insn:fence.i[] instruction. A insn:fence.i[] instruction ensures that a
+subsequent instruction fetch on a RISC-V hart will see any previous data stores
+already visible to the same RISC-V hart. insn:fence.i[] does _not_ ensure that
+other RISC-V harts' instruction fetches will observe the local hart's stores in
